  "title": "Cornish Finnish Michigan Pasties",
  "description": "Hearty and savory, these generously filled pastry pies are stuffed with ground beef and pork, rutabagas, potatoes, carrots and onions. These delicious pastry-filled packets are then baked and served warm or at room temperature. This recipe yields 8 pasties.",
  "authors": [
